        <item>
            <title>0.8.226</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 01:33:28 -0500</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/devops-senpai/Arma</link>
            <sparkle:version>800226</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.226</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Arma 0.8.226 preview.

- Drag the top of a page to move the window, as in Arc, wherever nothing there takes a click; text you can select and links still work.
- The Opened in Background Tab notice stays longer, waits while your pointer is on it, and offers Show Tab. Notices with a button take your click instead of the page under them.
- The Save password? prompt has a close button, closes after a few seconds you can set, and offers Never for This Website. Each Space’s Passwords settings list the websites it never offers to save on, with Include subdomains per site.
- Type @passwords in the command palette to find a saved login and copy its username, password or website, fill it into the page, or open the site.
- Choose whether showing or copying a saved password asks you to authenticate each time, every 15 minutes, or not at all.
- Check for Updates rolls out a hidden sidebar to show its answer, and @update checks from the command palette.
- New Spaces start with Arma's gold and red crest.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/devops-senpai/Arma/releases/download/v0.8.226/Arma-0.8.226.dmg" length="191895045" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="SBQrlf7+c1iGBxOQNI8rNBLiD+PRu0iHDb6Y9xgBeZSJ77/XVCks0evKvSbjqPHoppAJ0A4lOqR3JkX7/8TLCw=="/>
